xt":"この花…どうして散っちゃったんだ？","nextNodeIds":[10140108]},{"nodeId":10140108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":209301,"speakerName":"ピンばあや","textMapHash":3655708705,"text":"ばあやが若い頃、この「琉璃百合」は人の感情がわかると言われておった。","nextNodeIds":[10140109]},{"nodeId":10140109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":209301,"speakerName":"ピンばあや","textMapHash":4273831697,"text":"たとえば笑い声や歌声…楽しそうな声を聞くと、花も喜んで綺麗に咲くんじゃよ。","nextNodeIds":[10140110]},{"nodeId":10140110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":209301,"speakerName":"ピンばあや","textMapHash":593877281,"text":"逆に良くないこと…たとえば、でたらめな噂話なんぞを聞くと、すぐに枯れてしまう。","nextNodeIds":[10140111]},{"nodeId":10140111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3808342649,"text":"…じゃあ、この花たちは今、璃月港の現状を感じ取ってるんだな。","nextNodeIds":[10140112]},{"nodeId":10140112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":209301,"speakerName":"ピンばあや","textMapHash":2419309129,"text":"そうじゃ、岩王帝君が死んだなんて噂はただ事じゃない。いろんな噂が流れとるよ。","nextNodeIds":[10140113]},{"nodeId":10140113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":209301,"speakerName":"ピンばあや","textMapHash":3366046041,"text":"ファデュイの陰謀だの、「海にいるあれ」が暴れたからだの、七星の自作自演だと言う者もおる…","nextNodeIds":[10140114]},{"nodeId":10140114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":209301,"speakerName":"ピンばあや","textMapHash":587901801,"text":"この港はまるでマッチの山みたいじゃ。小さな火が付いただけで、それが一気に燃え広がる。","nextNodeIds":[10140115]},{"nodeId":10140115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":209301,"speakerName":"ピンばあや","textMapHash":156890369,"text":"はあ、この話はここまで。ばあやは年寄りじゃから、小言を言うのが癖でな…して若者、何か用かい？","nextNodeIds":[10140116,10140121]},{"nodeId":10140116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2758882009,"text":"「洗塵の鈴」を借りたい…","nextNodeIds":[10140117]},{"nodeId":10140117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":209301,"speakerName":"ピンばあや","textMapHash":185055689,"text":"ああ、あれか…覚えとるよ。確かに持っとるが…どこにやったか。","nextNodeIds":[10140118]},{"nodeId":10140118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":209301,"speakerName":"ピンばあや","textMapHash":1401156409,"text":"あの鈴は、ばあやが若い頃にある友達が持っていたものなんじゃ…","nextNodeIds":[10140119]},{"nodeId":10140119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":209301,"speakerName":"ピンばあや","textMapHash":1010493625,"text":"その鈴をじっと見つめていたら、彼がばあやにくれたんじゃよ。","nextNodeIds":[10140120]},{"nodeId":10140120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":209301,"speakerName":"ピンばあや","textMapHash":3418822449,"text":"あのとき彼は言っておった、今後誰かがこの鈴を借りに来たら、必ず渡してほしいと。","nextNodeIds":[10140127]},{"nodeId":10140127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":209301,"speakerName":"ピンばあや","textMapHash":113935457,"text":"過去に、この鈴が借りられることは何度もあったのじゃが。","nextNodeIds":[10140128]},{"nodeId":10140128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":209301,"speakerName":"ピンばあや","textMapHash":1354790209,"text":"いつの間にか、鈴を借りに来る人はいなくなっておった…","nextNodeIds":[10140129]},{"nodeId":10140129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":209301,"speakerName":"ピンばあや","textMapHash":3171556049,"text":"ふう、ばあやの老いた体じゃ探すのにちと時間がかかりそうじゃ、少し待っててくれるかね…","nextNodeIds":[10140130,10140133]},{"nodeId":10140130,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3699224745,"text":"自分たちで探す。","nextNodeIds":[10140131]},{"nodeId":10140131,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":674118417,"text":"そうだよ、おばあちゃん。家まで送るから、探すのはオイラたちに任せてくれよな。","nextNodeIds":[10140132]},{"nodeId":10140132,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3824496513,"text":"ついでに、部屋の片付けもしてやるからさ。","nextNodeIds":[10140135]},{"nodeId":10140135,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":209301,"speakerName":"ピンばあや","textMapHash":2315099945,"text":"子供たちや、鈴ならすぐ近くに保管してあるから心配無用じゃよ。","nextNodeIds":[10140136]},{"nodeId":10140136,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2398137729,"text":"ん？おばあちゃん家ってこの近くにあるのか？うわ…ここって玉京台だぞ、金持ちなんだな…","nextNodeIds":[10140137]},{"nodeId":10140137,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":209301,"speakerName":"ピンばあや","textMapHash":76654137,"text":"ほぉっほぉっ、ばあやじゃ城内に屋敷なぞ買えんよ——この壺を見ておくれ、ばあやの荷物は全部ここに入っておる。","nextNodeIds":[10140138]},{"nodeId":10140138,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1991935089,"text":"荷物が全部…","nextNodeIds":[10140139,10140140,10140143]},{"nodeId":10140139,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3765922785,"text":"家の鍵もこの中に？","nextNodeIds":[10140146]},{"nodeId":10140146,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":209301,"speakerName":"ピンばあや","textMapHash":886486865,"text":"ほぉっほぉっ…とにかく、鈴はこの壺の中にある。鈴が欲しいなら、中を覗いてみるとよい。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":10140140,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3026848753,"text":"荷物って、まさか鈴だけ？","nextNodeIds":[10140141]},{"nodeId":10140141,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4223664105,"text":"失礼だぞ！","nextNodeIds":[10140142]},{"nodeId":10140142,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":52375497,"text":"そ、そうだとしても、き、きっと貴重な鈴なんだ！おばあちゃん、そうだよな？","nextNodeIds":[10140146]},{"nodeId":10140143,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2708995473,"text":"パイモン、壺に入って探してくれる？","nextNodeIds":[10140144]},{"nodeId":10140144,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3379035033,"text":"入るか！どう考えてもオイラが入れるわけないだろ！？","nextNodeIds":[10140145]},{"nodeId":10140145,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3289103585,"text":"それに入る必要もない、蓋を開けて中を見ればいいじゃないか！","nextNodeIds":[10140146]},{"nodeId":10140133,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2845328161,"text":"ジンさんから探し物のコツを学んだ。","nextNodeIds":[10140134]},{"nodeId":10140134,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1095807409,"text":"おう…いきなり自慢か！？","nextNodeIds":[10140135]},{"nodeId":10140121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":784068097,"text":"あるものを借りに来た…","nextNodeIds":[10140122]},{"nodeId":10140122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":209301,"speakerName":"ピンばあや","textMapHash":2960362985,"text":"あるもの？ああ…「洗塵の鈴」を借りに来たのかい？","nextNodeIds":[10140123]},{"nodeId":10140123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":209301,"speakerName":"ピンばあや","textMapHash":1272040513,"text":"それ以外、若者が求めるものなぞ、このばあやは持っていないからね。","nextNodeIds":[10140124]},{"nodeId":10140124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":209301,"speakerName":"ピンばあや","textMapHash":2202480081,"text":"でも、その鈴はばあやのものではない、ある友達が持っていたものなんじゃ。","nextNodeIds":[10140125]},{"nodeId":10140125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":209301,"speakerName":"ピンばあや","textMapHash":3292194841,"text":"若い頃、ばあやは綺麗なものが好きでね。鈴が気に入ったから譲ってくれと友達にお願いしたんじゃ…","nextNodeIds":[10140126]},{"nodeId":10140126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":209301,"speakerName":"ピンばあや","textMapHash":276152297,"text":"そんなばあやに参ったのか、友達が鈴をくれてのう。でもそのとき、今後誰かがこの鈴を借りに来たら、必ず渡してほしいと言われたんじゃ。","nextNodeIds":[10140127]},{"nodeId":10140105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2724558377,"text":"どうしたの？","nextNodeIds":[10140106]},{"nodeId":10140106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":209301,"speakerName":"ピンばあや","textMapHash":4001575905,"text":"ああ、気にせんでくれ。ただこの「琉璃百合」が散っていくのを見て、もったいないと思っておっただけじゃ。","nextNodeIds":[10140107]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[101401,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3","133107094,1"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_REFRESH_GROUP_SUITE"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["209301"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"