nodeId":10140411,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":527661417,"text":"時間があったら…いい茶葉を持って、彼女に会いに行こう。","nextNodeIds":[10140412]},{"nodeId":10140412,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1787505161,"text":"それで、儀式にはあとなにが必要なんだ？","nextNodeIds":[10140413]},{"nodeId":10140413,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":288733801,"text":"ああ、次は…<color=#00E1FFFF>凧</color>を買いに行くぞ。","nextNodeIds":[10140414]},{"nodeId":10140414,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":582669025,"text":"凧！一緒に遊んでくれるのか？まさか…休憩時間？","nextNodeIds":[10140415]},{"nodeId":10140415,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":3120514529,"text":"ハハッ、違う。凧は子供のおもちゃだが、璃月の儀式においては他にも象徴的な意味合いを持つ。","nextNodeIds":[10140416]},{"nodeId":10140416,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":3243095833,"text":"詳しくはあとで説明する、まずは凧を手に入れよう。","nextNodeIds":[10140417]},{"nodeId":10140417,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2723143729,"text":"むぅっ…よくわからないけど、わかった…","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":10140405,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2221541657,"text":"鍾離先生も仙人なの？","nextNodeIds":[10140406]},{"nodeId":10140406,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":3115801633,"text":"仙人…","nextNodeIds":[10140407]}]},{"talkId":101410,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"particip